// Episode 2, level 1: the Port Ruckus freight harbour at night, where the hive's first breach was
// spotted. Coordinates in metres, x = east, y = north, z = up. The quay and yards are at z 0, the
// harbour water at z -3, the ship's main deck at z 0.5 and its bridge at z 3.5.
// Route: the landward approach (start west, facing east) → the checkpoint lane between two glass
// guard huts (the shotgun in the north booth) → the gate yard (a parked container truck) → the
// west container lane (stacks one, two and three high) → the open container tunnel through the
// stack wall → the east container lane: the demolition crew's control container in the south
// wall (its switch fires channel 3: a rumble, then a scripted blast blows open the welded stack
// in the east wall) → through the breach to the office forecourt → the harbour office: the lobby
// (reception counter, vending machine, payphone) and the open stairs up to the mezzanine → the
// manager's office and the Blue key → drop off the mezzanine where the glass rail is missing →
// the blue door in the lobby's north wall → the back corridor → the crane yard (stacks, a
// forklift, the maintenance shed with the jetpack; the chaingun between two stacks) → the steel
// stairs up to the gantry crane's cabin (z 3) over the quay → onto the container platform docked
// at the cabin's loading gate; the cabin's control panel (channel 4) sends the crane platform
// across the dark water to the cargo ship's bridge wing → the bridge (screens, the console; the
// Red key) → the lift down to the crew mess → the deck door → the main deck (hatch covers, deck
// containers, the mast) → the red hatch in the forecastle → the stairs down into the hold,
// flooded with toxic slime: south walkway, east walkway → the hive growth creeping through the
// bow → the exit switch on the hive wall.
// Shortcuts and recovery: the switch on the deck post (channel 6) opens the gangway gate, a way
// back to the quay; the post on the bridge wing and the cabin panel call the platform either way;
// a player who falls in the water rides a ladder lift (in each basin, by the quay) back up.
// Secrets: (1) the welded container in the west lane's south wall cracks open on a blast (the
// barrel beside it): pipe bombs and shells (validate warns its items "cannot be reached from the
// start": a crack-wall stash, by design); (2) a crouch vent low in the manager's east wall into
// the archive (armour, a medkit); (3) a jetpack-only ledge on top of the crane's east leg, 8 m
// over the quay (an atom; validate warns it "cannot be reached from the start", by design).
(
    name: "Container Crush",
    defaults: (floor_z: 0.0, ceil_z: 10.0, floor: "asphalt", ceil: "sky", wall: "container"),
    music: Some("container_crush"),
    player_start: (pos: (3.0, 19.0), angle_deg: 0.0),
    sectors: [
        // ---- The landward gate and the checkpoint ----
